    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10617" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιτορ-έω</span></b> , (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετορεῖν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bore
